WEBVTT

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:11.360
At last! Today is the day!

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:21.000
Onee-chan, breakfast is rea-

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:22.460
-dy...

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:25.550
Are you all right?

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:30.880
She's a lost cause...

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:10.330
Aoi-chan, hurry, hurry!

00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:11.860
Calm down, Ami.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:17.440
It's finally here,
my very own road bike!

00:02:30.570 --> 00:02:31.850
Hey there!

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:35.710
Hinako-san, Yayoi-san! Hello!

00:02:35.710 --> 00:02:36.880
Hello.

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:38.980
Congrats on your road bike, Ami.

00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:40.510
Congratulations!

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:43.840
Did you get our gifts attached?

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:44.890
Yes!

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:47.020
Hey, looks great!

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:51.270
Thank you so much for all the help!

00:02:51.640 --> 00:02:54.410
All the paperwork's done,

00:02:54.410 --> 00:02:56.960
All that's left is for you to ride it home, Ami.

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:02.960
I can ride a road bike at last!

00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:06.660
I know that feeling.

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:11.200
Lastly, I'm going to explain how to change gears-paca.

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:12.750
Okay!

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:14.730
You think she can manage?

00:03:14.730 --> 00:03:15.920
She'll be fine.

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:18.990
We'll escort her home.

00:03:18.990 --> 00:03:21.080
That's why we came.

00:03:22.730 --> 00:03:27.210
Just don't think too hard,
and adjust it to suit your ride-paca.

00:03:27.210 --> 00:03:28.690
Yes, okay.

00:03:37.010 --> 00:03:39.350
My very own road bike!

00:03:39.350 --> 00:03:41.820
It's your first time, so let's take it slow.

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:42.950
Okay!

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:48.410
Slight bumps and grooves can throw off your control, so be careful.

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:49.850
Understood!

00:03:51.150 --> 00:03:52.980
Okay then, let's go!

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:30.330
Um...

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:31.880
Was it like this?

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:44.590
O-One more time.

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:57.920
Riding a road bike feels so good!

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:07.490
You're doing pretty well.

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:11.240
With road bikes, your posture leans forward.

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:16.250
Some beginners find it scary
or have a hard time adjusting.

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:18.200
Scary?

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:22.510
It doesn't bother me at all.

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:27.510
Okay, let's keep on going!

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:28.740
Yes!

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:11.580
Hinako-san must be climbing at a slow pace...

00:06:12.320 --> 00:06:13.730
Still...

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:15.730
Still...

00:06:18.490 --> 00:06:21.230
Road bikes are amazing!

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:34.360
Ami, how was that?

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:38.250
It was really amazing!

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:42.000
I never imagined cycling could be this comfortable.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.500
It's like I grew wings.

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:47.470
Well, I'm glad to hear that.

00:06:47.470 --> 00:06:49.380
But...

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:52.340
I feel it a little in my neck and back.

00:06:52.340 --> 00:06:56.650
Well, you're not used to the posture,
so that's to be expected.

00:06:56.650 --> 00:06:59.300
You just have to keep riding and get used to it...

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:04.150
Is anything wrong?

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:08.150
No... An acquaintance is just cycling nearby.

00:07:08.150 --> 00:07:11.780
I rarely ever run into her.

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:14.060
Oh, is it Saki-chan?

00:07:14.060 --> 00:07:15.280
Yeah!

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:18.120
Is it okay if she joins us?

00:07:19.690 --> 00:07:20.330
Sure!

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:24.150
Hinako-san and Yayoi-san's friend?
I wonder what she's like.

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:27.840
Anyway,

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:31.620
this is our cycling companion,
she goes to our college.

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:33.650
Takamiya Saki.

00:07:33.650 --> 00:07:35.310
Nice to meet you!

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:41.350
She's always working part-time or on a bike trip,
so she hardly ever shows her face.

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:51.400
You're the person...

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:52.860
from Shibu Pass!

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:55.740
You're that girl Indy-kun was attacking!

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:58.480
What? You know each other?

00:07:58.480 --> 00:08:01.250
Remember, I told you about it.

00:08:01.720 --> 00:08:05.340
That amazing person we met at Shibu Pass...
this is her!

00:08:05.340 --> 00:08:08.040
Talk about coincidence.

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:10.010
Huh?

00:08:13.210 --> 00:08:15.620
A road bike? Not a folding bike?

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:16.800
Yes!

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:19.100
I couldn't help myself!

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:21.530
It was just delivered today.

00:08:21.530 --> 00:08:24.440
Hey, congratulations!

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:27.800
And? How did it feel to ride a road bike?

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:34.950
I've never ridden anything like a road bike.

00:08:35.890 --> 00:08:37.660
It really...

00:08:40.650 --> 00:08:44.180
It really expanded my world!

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:47.640
I see.

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:50.190
That's right.

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:55.960
With this bike,
I think I can do things I've never done before.

00:08:57.580 --> 00:08:58.800
By the way, Ami...

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:03.790
Your eyes are red. Are you okay?

00:09:03.790 --> 00:09:07.310
Actually, my eyes do sting a little.

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:08.720
Why is that?

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:10.490
Oh dear...

00:09:11.410 --> 00:09:16.350
You didn't need eyewear before
since your pace was slow.

00:09:16.350 --> 00:09:18.450
Eyewear?

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:23.460
If you're going to ride at road bike speeds,
it's best to protect your eyes...

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:24.710
with something like this.

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:31.370
And a tire repair kit is good to have too.

00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:35.220
Getting a flat tire on the road can turn into a tragedy.

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:39.740
How much does all that cost?

00:09:39.740 --> 00:09:42.820
Let's see... The affordable ones are...

00:09:42.820 --> 00:09:45.980
Maybe 15,000 to 20,000 yen altogether?

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:55.440
Why does it cost so much just to ride a bike?!

00:10:05.840 --> 00:10:07.330
We're here!

00:10:08.760 --> 00:10:09.980
Did you hear her?

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:12.130
So cute.

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:21.600
Um...!

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:25.350
Would you like to go cycling this weekend?

00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:29.600
Weren't we going next week?

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:33.360
I can't wait to ride my new machine.

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:37.610
I can't forget how it felt that first day.

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:41.740
Sorry, I have to work.

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:45.870
I'm sorry. I have some family duties.

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:49.370
Aoi-chan, how about you?

00:10:50.930 --> 00:10:53.790
Sorry! I have plans.

00:10:56.370 --> 00:10:58.720
No way...!

00:11:00.140 --> 00:11:02.390
But it was such a nice day,

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:04.740
I just couldn't resist!

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:07.530
Oh, I know!

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:15.390
"I made it to Enoshima all by myself!"

00:11:16.120 --> 00:11:21.160
"I'm planning to stop by Iida Dairy Farm
on the way home for a soft serve ice cream!"

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:21.960
Send!

00:11:23.980 --> 00:11:25.070
And then there's...

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:27.910
Hinako-san and the others.

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:33.290
But still...

00:11:34.180 --> 00:11:36.370
I can't believe I made it!

00:11:37.900 --> 00:11:40.830
Oh no, where am I?!

00:11:46.320 --> 00:11:47.890
Okay then...

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:50.700
Time to go.

00:11:57.020 --> 00:11:59.570
The breeze feels so good blowing from behind.

00:12:00.760 --> 00:12:03.100
Excuse me, I'm passing.

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:05.780
Oh, sure.

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:12.980
So fast!

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:15.790
Okay then...

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:31.490
I can keep up.

00:12:31.490 --> 00:12:33.630
A road bike is so fast.

00:12:34.330 --> 00:12:36.940
Even I can ride this fast!

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:42.440
She's letting me pass?

00:12:58.940 --> 00:13:00.360
Welco-

00:13:09.010 --> 00:13:12.530
What's with that get-up? You look so cute!

00:13:14.720 --> 00:13:16.880
Hey, can I take a picture?

00:13:16.880 --> 00:13:17.920
Go home!

00:13:19.870 --> 00:13:23.150
I'm so glad I got to see you in that.

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:25.890
But why are you wearing something like that?

00:13:25.890 --> 00:13:28.210
None of your business.

00:13:28.210 --> 00:13:32.160
Oh? You're going to take that attitude?

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:35.910
Maybe I'll send this photo to everyone...

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:43.300
If lots of people see it,
it'll be a boon for business.

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:48.800
I get paid twice as much for wearing this.

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:51.690
Then I guess it can't be helped.

00:13:54.460 --> 00:13:57.780
By the way... Ami-chan and Aoi-chan, was it?

00:13:57.780 --> 00:14:00.690
It's nice that those two cute, sincere girls have joined us.

00:14:02.180 --> 00:14:03.130
Aren't they?

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:05.410
Bringing them over to our side...

00:14:05.410 --> 00:14:07.950
...is going to be fun!

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:13.200
That said, Ami's still a beginner.

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:17.580
Apparently, she went cycling alone today,
so I'm a bit worried.

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:20.070
Look who's being a good senpai.

00:14:20.070 --> 00:14:21.720
It's normal. Normal!

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:24.700
Yayoi!

00:14:25.250 --> 00:14:26.860
Oh, dear!

00:14:26.860 --> 00:14:28.510
What are you doing?!

00:14:28.510 --> 00:14:29.470
Oh!

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:34.740
Now I've done it.

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:37.860
Even though it was brand new...

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:44.160
It's a good thing I listened to Hinako-san's advice.

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:54.870
Troubles that can happen to a beginner, huh...

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:56.050
Like a flat tire?

00:14:57.130 --> 00:15:00.120
It's quite hard at first.

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:05.460
Changing a tube takes getting used to.

00:15:08.990 --> 00:15:11.470
And there's a trick to attaching the tire.

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:15.470
In any case...

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:20.320
I don't want her to get frustrated and give up cycling.

00:15:20.320 --> 00:15:25.730
There aren't many female cyclists around our age.

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:27.730
You can say that again.

00:15:27.730 --> 00:15:31.090
Hinako-chan, you're so good at taking care of them.

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:34.990
See! You are a good senpai.

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:36.930
That's not it!

00:15:36.930 --> 00:15:42.310
She just started...
I just want her to love cycling.

00:15:42.310 --> 00:15:44.860
If you love cycling, it's only natural, right?

00:15:47.720 --> 00:15:50.910
Ami-chan and Aoi-chan are really cute though.

00:15:50.910 --> 00:15:54.330
You can't help but try your best... Right, Hinako-chan?

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:57.850
We made new friends. Of course, I'm happy.

00:15:57.850 --> 00:16:00.350
You're happy too, Yayoi.

00:16:02.350 --> 00:16:03.840
I did it!

00:16:04.350 --> 00:16:07.360
Okay... And the last step is...

00:16:21.760 --> 00:16:24.290
Why'd it rupture again?!

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:26.160
One more time!

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:29.300
And...

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:34.300
Again?!

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:38.180
What'll I do?!

00:16:38.180 --> 00:16:41.170
I'm out of spare tubes.

00:16:41.170 --> 00:16:43.810
Is there a bike shop nearby...?

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:46.690
Of course not...

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:54.320
For this to happen when I'm all alone... of all times!

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:55.500
What's the matter?

00:16:56.330 --> 00:16:57.790
Are you okay?

00:16:58.820 --> 00:17:01.080
Oh, a flat.

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:05.380
Probably that pothole from earlier...

00:17:04.720 --> 00:17:06.440
This jersey...

00:17:05.380 --> 00:17:07.040
It's dangerous isn't it?

00:17:06.440 --> 00:17:08.880
It's the same one Hinako-san wears.

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:08.040
Right?

00:17:08.880 --> 00:17:11.840
Do you have a spare tube?

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:14.390
Oh, well...

00:17:14.390 --> 00:17:16.090
I did, but...

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:21.300
I changed the tube, but it popped when I was pumping air.

00:17:21.300 --> 00:17:24.720
It was probably pinched between the rim and tire when you inflated it.

00:17:24.720 --> 00:17:26.230
Probably.

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:28.980
Tube was pinched?

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:31.230
Here, take this.

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:36.360
We have spares, so you can have it.

00:17:36.360 --> 00:17:39.370
We'll teach you the trick to changing the inner tube too.

00:17:44.350 --> 00:17:46.620
I did it!

00:17:50.060 --> 00:17:50.750
Oh...

00:17:51.360 --> 00:17:53.340
Thank you very much!

00:17:53.980 --> 00:17:56.260
We should help each other whenever we can.

00:17:56.270 --> 00:17:57.760
Don't worry about it.

00:18:03.140 --> 00:18:05.070
Okay, take care!

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:07.270
Okay!

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:09.270
Thank you!

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:17.810
I still have so many things to learn.

00:18:19.490 --> 00:18:20.990
Okay!

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:24.620
Let's go!

00:19:09.170 --> 00:19:12.660
"The soft serve is delicious!"

00:19:15.330 --> 00:19:18.410
It's so good! It's seeping into my bones!

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:50.320
Ami?

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:54.840
You haven't made it home yet?

00:20:00.900 --> 00:20:02.430
Aoi-chan!

00:20:02.430 --> 00:20:05.930
How come you're here?
Did you finish what you had to do?

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:07.680
Y-Yeah...

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:12.690
You messaged me about eating this soft serve.

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:15.630
And I got an irresistible craving for it.

00:20:18.990 --> 00:20:22.520
Aoi-chan... you're such a big eater!

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:24.200
H-Hey, don't laugh.

00:20:31.560 --> 00:20:32.300
You're so cute.

00:20:32.300 --> 00:20:33.960
Don't call me that.

00:20:34.300 --> 00:20:36.710
Aoi-chan, it seems like you're enjoying that.

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:39.090
Well, it's good, isn't it?

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:41.130
Yes, it is!

00:20:42.110 --> 00:20:43.540
It's really...

00:20:46.530 --> 00:20:47.650
Aoi-chan...

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:53.100
I realized after cycling alone today.

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:55.980
Cycling with everyone is...

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:58.690
a really, really wonderful thing.

00:20:59.570 --> 00:21:02.860
When I reached Enoshima...
and when I ate the soft serve...

00:21:03.440 --> 00:21:06.470
I felt like something was missing.

00:21:06.470 --> 00:21:08.120
Now I know what it was.

00:21:10.130 --> 00:21:11.500
So...!

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:15.380
I... I want to be with everyone from now.

00:21:15.380 --> 00:21:17.560
Instead of riding alone...

00:21:17.560 --> 00:21:21.130
being with you and everyone else is much more fun!

00:21:22.990 --> 00:21:27.140
Y-You sure are blunt, Ami.

00:21:27.140 --> 00:21:28.510
Really?

00:21:28.510 --> 00:21:30.060
Really.

00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:34.270
Well then...

00:21:37.410 --> 00:21:39.420
Let's ride home together.

00:21:44.030 --> 00:21:44.730
Okay!

00:23:28.440 --> 00:23:31.850
Buying a road bike has broadened my dreams!

00:23:31.850 --> 00:23:36.020
But there was something different about riding by myself.

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:39.270
Being with everyone is definitely more fun!

00:23:39.270 --> 00:23:45.780
Next time on Long Riders: "Fortuna."
